 READ at HEAD: cpu_mips_instr.c:4650-4657 (the syscall decode, no address or privilege gate), :2649-2650 (X(promemul)&#x27;s default arm: every machine type other than PMAX/PS2/ARC/SGI/EVBMIPS), :4659-4669 (#235&#x27;s address gate on the break form).  Not mipsresetalias, which is the break gate&#x27;s own alias defect.  A rung-3 ATTEMPT exists, made by claude-opus-4-8 in the Fable seat&#x27;s fallback run (so it is not a Fable ruling and owes review before it counts as the witness): regress/artifacts/adj_20261016/fable5/meas_D/witness_hostexit.py and .out, at HEAD e483d931 on the unmodified MIPS test machine (the PROM-trap default arm&#x27;s TODO message, then exit 1), each with a benign-instruction liveness control that stays alive.</span></span><span class="state st-open">open</span></span></th></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Assessment (initial problem)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Research (fix proposals)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Final review (flagship adjudication)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span><